c505e8da8115" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that a matrix of rank $5$ must have at least $5$ columns and at least $5$ rows. \nSo, we disregard the matrix $A$ since it has only $3$ rows and the matrix $C$ since it has only $4$ columns. \n\nAlso, the matrix must have $5$ pivot columns. As we can see, the matrix $B$ has exactly $5$ pivot columns. So, $\\text{rank}(B)=5.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$B$ only\"."] [:db/add "aefdf69a-f5d3-5963-8daa-c505e8da8115" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "aefdf69a-f5d3-5963-8daa-c505e8da8115" :question/answer-fields "f2a24c9e-618a-5202-9ff3-cd93a55078cc"] [:db/add "aefdf69a-f5d3-5963-8daa-c505e8da8115" :question/answer-fields "f0ff1952-5490-5f08-839e-5ce954bd9177"] [:db/add "aefdf69a-f5d3-5963-8daa-c505e8da8115" :question/answer-fields "519c238e-6853-5655-8cea-cab2ec56172c"] [:db/add "aefdf69a-f5d3-5963-8daa-c505e8da8115" :question/answer-fields "a6ac6993-81cd-50cd-a5dc-f60950e3c9a6"] [:db/ensure "aefdf69a-f5d3-5963-8daa-c505e8da8115" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186119848 :knowledge-point/questions "aefdf69a-f5d3-5963-8daa-c505e8da8115"] [:db/add "31ae6bd4-af46-5895-b8d2-1af2b3ab22a2" :answer/id #uuid "31ae6bd4-af46-5895-b8d2-1af2b3ab22a2"] [:db/add "31ae6bd4-af46-5895-b8d2-1af2b3ab22a2" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "31ae6bd4-af46-5895-b8d2-1af2b3ab22a2" :answer/value "$A$ only"] [:db/ensure "31ae6bd4-af46-5895-b8d2-1af2b3ab22a2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d13379b4-5cf4-5389-a27d-529f6cfd50e3" :answer/id #uuid "d13379b4-5cf4-5389-a27d-529f6cfd50e3"] [:db/add "d13379b4-5cf4-5389-a27d-529f6cfd50e3" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "d13379b4-5cf4-5389-a27d-529f6cfd50e3" :answer/value "$A$ and $C$ only"] [:db/ensure "d13379b4-5cf4-5389-a27d-529f6cfd50e3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8a9873b5-a61d-54e1-ae43-bf4dc7e8508c" :answer/id #uuid "8a9873b5-a61d-54e1-ae43-bf4dc7e8508c"] [:db/add "8a9873b5-a61d-54e1-ae43-bf4dc7e8508c" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "8